ontroller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modern platformer mimicking the good old days of classic platformers that require twitchy fingers and fast reflexes! Warning: this game is NOT EASY !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875310/extras/33fa2968de065347e5a4901b72672b63.poster.avif?t=1772454754\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875310/extras/33fa2968de065347e5a4901b72672b63.webm?t=1772454754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875310/extras/33fa2968de065347e5a4901b72672b63.mp4?t=1772454754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have an endless amount of lives, so you can quickly restart a level when you miss a jump, get hit by an enemy, get bitten by a plant, get hit by a spiky-ball, crushed by big statues, run onto spikes, get hit by a wasp, or any of the other many ways you'll get stopped in your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUT when you do complete a level, the rush you get will keep you coming back for more, and more, and more, and..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875310/extras/dededae0d7011a6c0fbcd52bd3d7be77.poster.avif?t=1772454754\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875310/extras/dededae0d7011a6c0fbcd52bd3d7be77.webm?t=1772454754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875310/extras/dededae0d7011a6c0fbcd52bd3d7be77.mp4?t=1772454754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the special Temple levels by finding hidden keys in every level of every world, and unlock a flip-mode by completing a level both within the time set, and also by collecting all the coins in a level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stardash is all about the gameplay thrown at you in awesome retro graphics and original chiptunes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic vibes thanks to the monochrome pixelart graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully designed levels (NOT procedural and NOT random)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and very challenging platform action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thumping and memorable chip-tune soundtrack - a true earworm!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret unlockable Temple levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875310/extras/f4c256b7442f98c21bb8a6228e4cf442.poster.avif?t=1772454754\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875310/extras/f4c256b7442f98c21bb8a6228e4cf442.webm?t=1772454754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875310/extras/f4c256b7442f98c21bb8a6228e4cf442.mp4?t=1772454754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Orangepixel"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875310/b69072e0871a3dc54b66bc502bcf0b3e80849c30/header.jpg?t=1772454754","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 ghz Dual Core<br></li><li><stro